This repository contains material derived from third-party work:

  src/amr_physical_ai/config/nav2_dwb.yaml
  src/amr_physical_ai/config/nav2_mppi.yaml
  src/amr_physical_ai/config/nav2_rpp.yaml

    Derived from nav2_bringup/params/nav2_params.yaml of Nav2 (navigation2, ROS 2 Jazzy),
    https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2, licensed under the Apache License,
    Version 2.0 (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt). Changed from that file: use_sim_time is set for
    every server, AMCL is given the initial pose, and the controller_server FollowPath block
    and controller_frequency are set for one controller per file (DWB, MPPI or RPP), as each
    file's header states.

Everything else that this software uses at run time (ROS 2, Nav2, SLAM Toolbox, Gazebo,
ros_gz, the TurtleBot3 simulation models, the language-model runner, models and speech
packages) is installed separately and is not distributed with it.
